description = "A Libretro core for playing classic video game music in RetroArch, with a built-in graphical interface: a browsable track list, VU meter, spectrum analyzer, and playback controls. Plays SPC/NSF/GBS/HES/KSS/SAP/AY/GYM (libgme), VGM/VGZ (libvgm) and PSF/PSF2/SSF (aosdk). Accepts .zip and .7z albums and plays tracks in natural order."
